  "notes": [
   "«أبي» is a bare relation: the father of the compiler's shaykh is not named here; the five names are co-transmitters at one level, and «قالوا» introduces the next level",
   "«جميعا» makes محمد بن يحيى العطار and أحمد بن إدريس co-transmitters meeting at سهل",
   "«سألت أبا الحسن» names the Imam in the words after the chain: he is the last link (owner ruling 2); «عليه السلام» and «رضي الله عنهم» are left out",
   "«محمد بن يحيى العطار» (level 2) is not the same surface as «أحمد بن محمد بن يحيى العطار» (level 1); the two are not merged (rule 9)"
  ],
